	(text "USB-C DOCK CHAIN (DP alt mode)\nU20 SN65DSI86: DSI1 (DPHY1) -> 2-lane DP HBR2. REFCLK=GND: DP PLL fed from DSI clock\n  (mainline ti-sn65dsi86 driver, I2C addr 0x2C on SDA1/SCL1). ML2/ML3 unused.\nU21 HD3SS460 assignment-D combo: ML0->LnA, ML1->LnB, LnC/LnD open (Table 3, SLLSEM7D).\n  USBC_TX/RX/SBU nets -> 24-pin USB-C receptacle SS pins (receptacle TBD).\nU22 TPS65987D: DRP, power sink / DP source. CC1/CC2 hierarchical - CM5 CC connection\n  must be REMOVED when TPS owns the port. PP_HV paths unused (VBUS -> BQ25798 direct).\n  Config image in U23 flash (TI Application Customization Tool). GPIO2=POL GPIO4=EN GPIO3=HPD.\n  I2C1 -> RP2350B (PD_I2C_*). MUX AC caps C91-C94 on TX pairs per HD3SS460 Fig 3."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 144.78 254 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "996936c5-3003-4e04-b9b1-f5e91c10a924")
	)
